描述:
I've been searching endless snow in summer and leaping fireworks in winter;
Having embraced thunderous applause, as well as jeer and sneer;
Behind the twilight, I'll dance with the sunset forever.

Only when flowers are covered with thorns can people's desires be overcome;
Only when fragrance overcomes toxicity can it have the ability to resist;
With a flash of inspiration, it turns attack into assistance;
And think for several days, and create a new era of magic.
